# index-fixed-read: Is a constant index name[n] read as the name followed by n in a formula (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: r=118
# pc: ok
# ruling: pc-ode reads `name[n]` as `name<n>` where a formula reads a name or calls a function; the integer is parsed, so `k[03]` is k3 (language.md, Arrays).
x'=-x
x(0)=1
par a2=3
f3=7
k3=100
g2(u)=u*2
aux r=f[3]+a[2]+g[2](4)+k[03]
@ total=1,dt=0.5
